"Reads your aircraft straight from Infinite Flight over Wi-Fi. Needs the sim running on another device on this network, with Connect switched on in its settings." = "Lee tu aeronave directamente de Infinite Flight por Wi-Fi. Necesita el simulador abierto en otro dispositivo de esta red, con Connect activado en sus ajustes.";
